    "group": "Khorne Daemonkin",
    "summary": "An enemy unit’s destruction by your World Eaters or Blood Legions triggers one D6 roll. A 3+ gives you 1 Blood Tithe point. As your Command phase opens, you may buy any number of affordable effects below. Each lasts until the battle ends. For 2 points, your World Eaters and Blood Legions models get Feel No Pain 5+ for two sources of damage, mortal wounds and attacks with the Psychic keyword. Blood Legions get Lance for melee weapons for 3 points, a 4+ invulnerable save for 4 points, or Blessings of Khorne for 5 points.",
